# Phase 104 UAT Evidence Directory

This directory holds the output of `bash docker/local-uat/scripts/test-install-sh.sh`:
- `walk-<timestamp>/` subdirs, one per UAT walk run
- Each subdir contains per-AC evidence files (01-install-success.txt ... 15-tcpdump.txt)
  + a `PASS-FAIL.md` matrix summarising PASS/FAIL/WARN/USER-WALKED status per AC

The `walk-*` subdirs are typically committed alongside the operator's UAT-CHECKLIST.md
sign-off so future engineers can audit what was verified for Phase 104.

Apple device screenshots from the user-walked AC-104-10 verification land in
`apple-walk-<timestamp>/` subdirs (created by the operator manually).

Operators: DO NOT commit log files containing secrets (Cloudflare API tokens, JWTs,
Redis passwords). The walk.mjs evidence files are designed to be safe to commit
(they capture HTTP codes, packet counts, dig results, cert subjects — never secrets).
